To compile the program OpenMP version with gfortran do the following
./configure -GNU -FFTW -OMP
make 
If all is fine,  the executable is in the subdir GNU-FFTW-OMP

To compile the program OpenMP/MPI version with gfortran do the following
./configure -GNU -FFTW -OMP -MPI
make 
If all is fine the executable is in the subdir GNU-FFTW-OMP-MPI

N.B. the fftw3 directory must be installed in the standard location and available in LD_PATH 




